{
  "_comment": "The PR tiers (scripts/ci/check-tiering.mjs). Each job of .github/workflows/ci.yml that calls a workflow is listed with its tier (fast: every push; heavy: only a ready PR whose fast tier passed) and the paths that start it (null: always). Patterns are GitHub path-filter patterns (** and *, a leading ! excludes). `always` files start every job: a change to the tiering itself must exercise all of it.",
